{"3638070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hermit Computer", "steam_appid": 3638070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/aa9bd6074babcfbacf125e1cfd307505.avif?t=1779808693\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras_big/aa9bd6074babcfbacf125e1cfd307505.avif?t=1779808693 width=800 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Hermit Kingdom, an isolated country under brutal hardship. Here, you must use their secure computer operating system and gather intel on the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hermit Computer</i></strong> is a horror-puzzle game set deep within a secretive hermit kingdom. You play as an American operative, captured while covertly gathering intel on the government. Now imprisoned in a high-security facility, your only tool is a restricted, state-run computer system. Use it to uncover secrets, navigate censored networks, and reach out to the U.S. Embassy—all while avoiding detection by patrolling guards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are ears everywhere.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/587eb1675a4d5a258df0dbec48b1469a.poster.avif?t=1779808693\" width=576 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/587eb1675a4d5a258df0dbec48b1469a.webm?t=1779808693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Careful not to be too loud-- there are ears everywhere in the Hermit Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather intel.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/822fb1a6437be858a9f4ddc6860e7d3c.poster.avif?t=1779808693\" width=576 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/822fb1a6437be858a9f4ddc6860e7d3c.webm?t=1779808693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and take pictures of all the secrets found on the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crack the puzzle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/883f1245cf9ed43d0e9cfcbee41b7aee.poster.avif?t=1779808693\" width=576 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/883f1245cf9ed43d0e9cfcbee41b7aee.webm?t=1779808693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be deterred by some passwords.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/aa9bd6074babcfbacf125e1cfd307505.avif?t=1779808693\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras_big/aa9bd6074babcfbacf125e1cfd307505.avif?t=1779808693 width=800 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Hermit Kingdom, an isolated country under brutal hardship. Here, you must use 